Awaaz repository license scope

The client SDK packages in sdk/, sdk-server/ and telephony/ are licensed under
MIT. Each package contains its own LICENSE with the complete terms and
copyright notice. The grant covers the corresponding client SDK and its
associated package documentation.

This repository-level notice does not grant a license to the voice worker,
control plane, admin API, tenant portal API, dashboard, internal tools,
operational data or other platform materials. Their rights remain reserved
unless separately licensed by their rights holders.

Third-party components retain their own licenses and notices.
